WEBVTT

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.090
I've seen him before.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.850
"Something the Dark,"
isn't it? He's filthy.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.190
Yeah, he's a mongrel.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.230
Out of the way.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.440
He really doesn't know his place.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.870
So you're Riki the Dark.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.540
A rat, just like your reputation says.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.160
What do you mean?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.670
You'll worry a lot
if you have a nice car.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.250
He fell for it!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:17.800
Watch your mouth.
We're all <i>citizens</i> of Midas.

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:20.470
Yeah? So what?

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.770
Someone has to teach
you some manners.

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:27.730
I don't have time to play
around with you lot.

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.480
We are...

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.940
the Elite Bodyguards!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:38.780
We're patrolling so that scum like you
don't roam around Midas!

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.700
Want us to call the police?!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.660
Cut the crap.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.200
"Elite Bodyguards," my ass!

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.280
Son of a...

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.110
Good, we've got him!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:26.160
So much for you "Elite Bodyguards," if you need four against one.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:26.580
Shut up!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.620
Hey.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.170
Try saying, "Help me."

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:36.010
You don't have the right to complain, even if you're killed.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.840
Does one rat frighten
you so much?

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:41.640
Shut up. We're serious!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.470
Grovel and beg.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.430
Your sort are worth
less than vermin.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.150
Go to hell!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.580
A-A Blondie.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.390
Who the hell are you?!
I didn't ask for your help!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.270
A mongrel, huh?

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.520
Go back to Ceres.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.230
Wait a sec!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.190
Why did you save me?!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.650
No particular reason.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:47.990
On principle, I won't owe anyone, not even an elite from Tanagura!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.040
Stop staring and follow me.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.670
I don't have a car,
so you'll have to walk.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.270
Let's get it over with.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.860
I'm only here to pay
back my debt.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.370
You plan to pay me back
with your body.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.120
I see. Very mongrel-like.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.790
So what if I'm a mongrel?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.080
I didn't ask to be born in the slums!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.800
I don't have anything
else to give you.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.420
Unfortunately for you,

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:46.050
I am not so desperate that I need to put my hands on a mongrel.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:51.100
Don't mock me!
You gonna do it or not?!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.940
If you insist so much,
I'll let you pay me.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.270
Take your clothes off and stand against the wall.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.610
Let's see this body
you boast about.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.630
Why... are you only looking?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.640
Don't worry. I'll enjoy myself.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.730
Aren't you gonna
take off your clothes?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:46.360
No idiot in Tanagura would take off his clothes to discipline a Pet.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.660
What's wrong? Finished already?

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:57.620
Cut it out already. I'm not a toy.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.590
Wh-Who are you?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:10.180
Iason Mink. Just a Blondie.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:25.480
Riki. It's been three years
since you left.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.530
Ceres hasn't changed.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.120
Watching the glittering nightless city, Midas,

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.410
and the elite's city,
Tanagura, from the side,

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.620
we pass our stagnant days here.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:46.340
You used to say, "I'm gonna climb out of this dump one day."

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.510
I always thought you'd make something of yourself and come back.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.720
So I waited here.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:07:01.520
Riki. Have you forgotten about Ceres and us members of Bison?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.110
We used to say

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:08.780
we didn't want to be stuck in Ceres,
but now we've turned twenty.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.950
Sometimes I think we're chained down here,
and it makes me shiver.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:19.000
Say, Riki, did you find
what you were looking for?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:24.590
Is there really a way out of this town for us mongrels without citizenship?

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:34.220
I'm sure the only one who knows the answer... is you, Riki.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.740
Run! They're gonna catch up!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.680
Shit.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.530
Luke, jump when I give the sign!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.530
Okay!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.870
No way! You're our leader!
Don't tell me you're running scared?!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.330
Killie, wait!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.000
I ain't having that!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.450
Run!

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.250
Everyone, go!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.710
R-Riki?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.680
Y-You're Riki, aren't you?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.640
Long time no see.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.300
Riki.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:49.710
Yo, where the hell have you been? You left your partner alone.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.590
Three years. Three years, man.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:59.090
Thanks to his taking over, Bison didn't break up.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.100
Bet you were doing
something bad up there.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.560
You're lookin' kinda grown up.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.190
It's nothing like that.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.520
Oh yeah, I haven't
introduced you yet.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:16.110
He's Killie. He joined
after you left.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.990
Say hi.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.200
Hi.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.820
I can't hear you!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.700
Hi!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.330
Way to go, virgin boy!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.460
What?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.750
Look, don't you think his eyes
are a bit like yours?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.420
I'm not a kid like him.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.630
What was that?!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:43.930
Come off it. He's no match for you, right, Guy?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:44.600
Yeah.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:49.560
Riki, nothing's changed these past three years.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:54.520
Guy's not to blame.
It's just this town.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:06.160
Ah, nothing ever changes.
Nothing at all.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:34.650
Here I was wondering what sort of great guy that "Riki the Dark" is.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:40.230
But you're just lazin' about every day and getting high on stout.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.780
You really the boss?

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:43.990
Hey, Killie!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.950
Mismatched eyes. That's rare.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.250
Don't talk about my eyes!

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:54.420
Instead, if you're the boss, let's talk about business.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.380
They have trippers
at the auction in Mistral.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:02.340
Don't tell me Bison's gonna miss out
on an opportunity like that?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.590
What if I say no?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.930
We'll decide by bike.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.810
If I win, we go to the auction.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.940
Okay, Mr. Leader?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:48.590
Go!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.180
What?

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.390
You son of a...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.820
Dammit!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.000
You really wanna get hurt, don't you?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.830
How old are you?
Bet you're still green.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.460
You chickened out!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:26.470
I'll decide about Bison. You just shut up and come with us.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.380
Th-Then we're going?

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.390
Yeah.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.720
Guy, look.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.810
Huh? What's up?

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.980
What's that?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.060
I don't know, but I suppose
it's also on sale.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.190
I don't understand guys
who'd want <i>this</i> as a Pet.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.950
Let's go.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.030
Hey!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.870
Those trippers are for
the west warehouse.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:40.080
You sure? I was told they'd be here.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.670
No, twenty of them are gonna be moved down there.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.420
Right, then I'll go.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.630
Thanks, I appreciate it.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.810
Is it really here?

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.820
Gotcha.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.740
No sweat.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.700
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.620
Excuse me. Your attention please.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.670
This is Number B-1608.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.590
Bidding starts at 20 million credits.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.500
20! 20 million!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.710
22!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:31.550
25!

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:33.760
Point 2!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.390
25.2!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.470
33!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.510
35!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.450
Iason!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:17.390
Hey, he's looking over here! Maybe he's interested in us.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.600
It'd be a great chance
to get to know a Blondie.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.430
Don't be stupid!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.770
What'cha so tense about?
You afraid of the Blondies?

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.770
Guy, let's go.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.820
Fucking Riki.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:16.650
Pet? Oh, you mean him.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.870
He's a mongrel from the slums.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.160
I can't apply the Pet
administration laws to him.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.420
It was just some trippers.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.090
Were you displeased
that I let them go?

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:49.060
It's hardly necessary
for any warnings now.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.740
You're late. Did Jupiter
say something?

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.700
Yeah.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.040
Is it about that mongrel
called Riki?

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.910
I guess it is.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.290
That's why I told you not to.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:57.000
Listen. This is you. This is Riki.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.340
What you're doing is this.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:09.560
So I'm the foolish knight going
for the pawn when I'm in check?

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:13.270
It's no laughing matter.
If I were Jupiter, I'd do this.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.650
It's the obvious move.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.990
Got it. Say no more.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:28.870
Excuse me, you have a guest.
A mongrel from Ceres called Killie.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.250
Make him wait in the lobby.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.290
No, call Katze and have him attend to the matter.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.930
Are you Killie?

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.890
Who are you?

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.150
Did you think Iason would come?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:03.820
Unfortunately, the elite have no time to waste on seeing a punk like you.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.860
What?!

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:10.830
We'll talk business. All you need to do is follow my orders.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:14.580
Even if it means
betraying your gang.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.790
I came to see Iason, the Blondie!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:25.260
You're quite assertive, but your answer is either "yes" or "no."

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:30.760
However, if you say "no,"
I can't guarantee anything.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.310
A-All right.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.310
I'll really be working for Iason, right?

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.270
You don't have to do it
if you don't trust me.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:41.440
N-No, it's not that.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.030
Wh-What's your name?

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:48.990
If you're thinking about getting along in the market,

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:53.950
you'd better remember
the name Katze.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.840
I just saw Killie in the street.

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:03.800
He's got a real nice car,
and he's bossing everyone around.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.800
I heard he's doing some dirty work.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:09.050
He's selling out his mates
to the androids,

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:12.310
and as a reward,
he gets to do it with Pets.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:18.400
Really? I heard he's hanging around
with Katze, the black market broker.

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.230
What's he doing for Katze?

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.770
Things I wouldn't dare say.

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:24.320
Like what?

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:27.950
I dunno! Anyway, that guy has a real bad reputation.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:36.160
You guys never change.

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:40.000
My, my. I thought you were some kind of prince.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:43.880
Haven't you abandoned us already?

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:46.210
Hey, don't be so petty.

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:48.840
I've got a deal for you.

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:51.090
What kind of deal?

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:54.510
It's only transporting goods,
but I don't have the manpower.

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:56.810
So here I am.

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:59.390
How about it?

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:01.310
So there's no pay for us?

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:03.770
Aren't you even gonna let us do it with a Pet?

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:07.820
I wouldn't even mind if it's you.
I heard you're getting it pretty good.

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:13.740
The job pays 30,000 credits.
How's 5,000 credits per head?

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:15.200
5,000 credits?!

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:16.240
You're joking.

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:19.540
Hey, is this job dangerous?

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.880
If you don't want it, that's fine. I'll go somewhere else.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.250
Hey, hey, just a minute, Killie!
It's just transporting goods, right?

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:31.930
Well, don't be so hasty. Let's listen to your leader's opinion.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:38.850
It's a Midas job, right?

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:41.600
That's right, involving Pets.

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.810
Well now, ya gonna do it or not?

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:48.030
I don't trust you.

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:52.660
Oh, that's just too bad.
Well, have a little talk about it.

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:54.990
I'll be in touch. See ya.

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:36.320
Riki?

00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:38.700
Y-Yeah.

00:24:38.700 --> 00:24:40.120
It's been four years.

00:24:40.750 --> 00:24:41.290
Yeah.

00:24:48.040 --> 00:24:49.090
What is it?

00:24:53.170 --> 00:24:54.090
No thanks.

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:58.300
There's something fishy
about Killie's story.

00:24:58.300 --> 00:25:03.480
I want to know
who's behind all of this.

00:25:03.980 --> 00:25:06.020
Who do <i>you</i> think it is?

00:25:06.650 --> 00:25:09.770
He had a Midas Pet dealer's ring on.

00:25:10.690 --> 00:25:13.800
I used to do errands
for you before,

00:25:13.800 --> 00:25:16.660
and I know the ring
doesn't come cheap.

00:25:18.370 --> 00:25:21.080
It's you, isn't it, Katze?

00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:27.630
Why don't you come straight out
and say it's Iason?

00:25:28.880 --> 00:25:31.090
What are you gonna do to my gang?

00:25:34.510 --> 00:25:36.890
You know what this is?

00:25:37.430 --> 00:25:39.800
An identification tag for a Furniture.

00:25:46.900 --> 00:25:50.270
I used to be Iason's Furniture.

00:25:51.820 --> 00:25:54.940
I was a Blondie's exclusive Furniture,

00:25:54.940 --> 00:25:58.780
and one day I got hold
of some information.

00:25:58.780 --> 00:25:59.950
About what?

00:25:59.950 --> 00:26:01.490
Tanagura's secret.

00:26:02.950 --> 00:26:06.330
Once you taste curiosity, there's no stopping.

00:26:07.250 --> 00:26:10.540
I used the terminal in my room for six months to find out.

00:26:11.750 --> 00:26:14.690
I, who had been treated
as living furniture,

00:26:14.690 --> 00:26:16.880
was stealing the secret of Tanagura.

00:26:18.800 --> 00:26:22.390
The thrill of quitting just before the tracing sensors activated

00:26:22.390 --> 00:26:25.180
gave me the illusion of excitement.

00:26:29.690 --> 00:26:32.770
I didn't think a mere Furniture could do so much.

00:26:34.190 --> 00:26:38.150
You're good. It would be
a shame to get rid of you.

00:26:41.070 --> 00:26:43.330
How about you use
your skills for me?

00:26:48.710 --> 00:26:50.730
Don't underestimate Iason.

00:26:51.710 --> 00:26:55.130
And if you really want to be free,

00:26:55.130 --> 00:26:57.720
leave Tanagura.

00:26:59.220 --> 00:27:00.640
That's all.

00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:08.640
Katze...

00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:09.810
Just get out!

00:27:35.460 --> 00:27:39.010
Now Killie's talked us
into it, after all.

00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:42.800
Where'd you go after that?

00:27:42.800 --> 00:27:43.720
Just out for a bit.

00:27:54.020 --> 00:27:56.190
Don't underestimate Iason.

00:28:00.110 --> 00:28:05.120
Riki, you're acting strange.
Are you hiding something?

00:28:08.240 --> 00:28:12.000
Guy, what would you do
if I left Bison?

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:13.420
What?

00:28:13.420 --> 00:28:16.420
So something <i>is</i> wrong, isn't it?

00:28:16.420 --> 00:28:18.960
You can't even tell me?

00:28:18.960 --> 00:28:21.420
No, never mind. Forget it.

00:28:24.720 --> 00:28:27.850
Guy, keep your eyes on Killie.

00:28:27.850 --> 00:28:29.390
If there's any trouble,

00:28:30.020 --> 00:28:31.770
run, no matter what.

00:28:49.580 --> 00:28:51.700
Looks like they made their deal.

00:28:52.080 --> 00:28:55.920
Hey, Killie, show us the goods before you stack 'em in.

00:28:55.920 --> 00:28:58.130
I'll lose sleep thinking about it.

00:28:58.130 --> 00:29:00.170
Well, okay.

00:29:06.140 --> 00:29:07.140
Whoa, these are...

00:29:11.980 --> 00:29:15.140
Wow, man! They're class-A Pets!

00:29:15.770 --> 00:29:18.110
Wh-What's gonna happen to them?

00:29:18.980 --> 00:29:25.070
They're exported from this port to millionaires and VIPs on border planets.

00:29:25.530 --> 00:29:27.660
A hundred million credits per body.

00:29:28.370 --> 00:29:30.540
Now guess how much
that makes in total.

00:29:31.200 --> 00:29:34.500
Six containers, so sixty bodies...

00:29:34.500 --> 00:29:37.460
Damn! Six billion credits?!

00:29:38.840 --> 00:29:41.170
Compare it with your wallet.

00:29:41.170 --> 00:29:45.340
You can't do this business if you make a fuss about that amount of money.

00:29:50.560 --> 00:29:52.520
Hey, Killie, what's this about?

00:29:57.190 --> 00:29:59.400
Meeting's over. See ya!

00:29:59.400 --> 00:30:00.360
Killie!

00:30:09.820 --> 00:30:12.290
Everyone run, quick!

00:30:55.700 --> 00:30:56.500
Guy!

00:30:58.540 --> 00:31:02.000
Riki, you're gonna die
if you jump from here.

00:31:06.880 --> 00:31:08.010
Riki!

00:31:08.010 --> 00:31:09.680
Guy!

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:23.360
What the hell do you
think you're doing?!

00:31:24.110 --> 00:31:29.110
Calm down. There's nothing
you can do on your own.

00:31:30.910 --> 00:31:33.320
Bastard!

00:31:38.370 --> 00:31:41.920
What's going on, huh? Tell me!

00:31:41.920 --> 00:31:45.880
What if I say "no"?
Ya gonna throw me overboard?

00:31:46.420 --> 00:31:48.550
It won't do you any good.

00:32:11.900 --> 00:32:13.450
Katze...

00:32:13.820 --> 00:32:18.580
Riki, I thought you had
more sense than this,

00:32:18.580 --> 00:32:21.460
but I suppose you couldn't beat your feelings.

00:32:21.870 --> 00:32:24.630
Fine job. Now go.

00:32:43.900 --> 00:32:48.190
Take him to the Midas Police Center,
but don't hurt him.

00:32:50.320 --> 00:32:53.930
You bastard! Where's Guy?! And the others?!

00:32:53.930 --> 00:32:56.530
Playing dirty tricks on us!

00:32:56.530 --> 00:32:58.530
I warned you, Riki.

00:32:59.080 --> 00:33:04.500
Do you have the determination
to fight the whole of Tanagura?

00:33:29.980 --> 00:33:33.120
Yes, I understand.
I'll arrange for it immediately.

00:33:38.820 --> 00:33:41.660
There's been an order
from above to release Riki.

00:33:41.660 --> 00:33:45.120
What'd'ya mean?!
He's the group's leader!

00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:49.040
Anyway, we'll discuss the details in the chief's office.

00:34:17.860 --> 00:34:19.450
You're being released.

00:34:19.450 --> 00:34:22.830
However, don't leave home.
Trying to escape might prove fatal.

00:34:27.040 --> 00:34:30.540
Pets should obediently lick their masters' boots.

00:34:30.540 --> 00:34:34.760
Your name is on the Pet registry.

00:34:43.430 --> 00:34:44.060
Guy.

00:34:45.180 --> 00:34:46.430
Riki.

00:34:46.430 --> 00:34:49.480
Guy! Guy, are you okay?

00:34:49.480 --> 00:34:50.650
Move on!

00:34:50.940 --> 00:34:51.860
Guy!

00:35:03.950 --> 00:35:07.410
You're bringing Riki back? Why?

00:35:07.410 --> 00:35:09.330
Didn't you set him free?

00:35:11.130 --> 00:35:12.790
Three years, Raoul.

00:35:12.790 --> 00:35:16.550
That's how long it took me
to tame Riki.

00:35:18.260 --> 00:35:23.430
I only removed his Pet ring
so he could have a bit of fresh air.

00:35:24.010 --> 00:35:27.770
I never intended to part with him.

00:35:27.770 --> 00:35:32.650
Iason, I'm serious
about this. Not him.

00:35:33.150 --> 00:35:35.900
Jupiter doesn't give second warnings.

00:35:36.980 --> 00:35:40.610
You should know that better than anyone else.

00:35:41.200 --> 00:35:45.660
Are you going to ruin your position as a Blondie for a mere mongrel?

00:35:45.660 --> 00:35:47.370
Jupiter...

00:35:47.370 --> 00:35:51.090
I have never made a mistake in my work up till now,

00:35:51.460 --> 00:35:54.250
and I never will.

00:35:54.250 --> 00:35:59.260
Compared to that,
a mongrel Pet is a minor issue.

00:35:59.260 --> 00:36:02.430
Don't rationalize to <i>me</i>!

00:36:02.430 --> 00:36:04.300
You know that's not the point.

00:36:04.300 --> 00:36:07.850
Keeping a mongrel Pet
is a problem in itself.

00:36:09.930 --> 00:36:14.560
Worse yet, you treat him as special.

00:36:14.560 --> 00:36:20.690
Iason, in Tanagura,
Jupiter equals order.

00:36:20.690 --> 00:36:23.530
What if you incur Jupiter's wrath?

00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:27.410
I'm the one who will have
to tamper with your mind.

00:36:27.990 --> 00:36:30.500
Hey. Are you listening?

00:36:41.720 --> 00:36:48.720
If I said I loved Riki,
would you laugh, Raoul?

00:37:11.790 --> 00:37:13.540
Fucking Iason.

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:22.840
It's been a long time.

00:37:35.020 --> 00:37:38.860
I-Iason. What the hell
are you doing here?

00:37:39.770 --> 00:37:43.320
Get out! I don't want to see your face ever again!

00:37:45.570 --> 00:37:48.200
I've come to fetch you.

00:37:48.910 --> 00:37:52.240
I see. So that's why
you crushed Bison.

00:37:53.000 --> 00:37:55.160
Give me back my gang!

00:37:55.620 --> 00:37:58.750
I'll let them go as soon as
they are able to walk.

00:38:05.300 --> 00:38:08.340
What about Guy?
What're you gonna do with him?

00:38:09.260 --> 00:38:10.970
Who knows?

00:38:10.970 --> 00:38:14.140
I might make him into a Pet or sell him off to Midas,

00:38:14.890 --> 00:38:19.610
or perhaps tamper with his mind a little and make him a docile sex doll.

00:38:19.610 --> 00:38:21.570
Y-You must be joking.

00:38:24.240 --> 00:38:27.150
Have I ever told a joke?

00:38:27.150 --> 00:38:29.280
However, I <i>could</i> let
him go unharmed.

00:38:29.950 --> 00:38:33.240
What do you want me to do?

00:38:33.700 --> 00:38:37.080
Return to Eos. Playtime is over.

00:38:37.460 --> 00:38:42.170
Why me?! Didn't you
set me free already?!

00:38:42.630 --> 00:38:45.710
Riki, I hope you haven't
mistaken me.

00:38:45.710 --> 00:38:50.300
Though I have removed your ring,
I haven't canceled your registration.

00:38:51.510 --> 00:38:57.180
You have been and
always will be my Pet.

00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:02.310
What do you fear?

00:39:04.650 --> 00:39:07.400
Have I ever treated you roughly?

00:39:19.040 --> 00:39:20.920
You are mine.

00:39:21.580 --> 00:39:22.880
Even if here and now...

00:39:24.800 --> 00:39:27.840
the world may shatter around us.

00:39:29.840 --> 00:39:32.300
Someday I'll kill you.

00:39:33.100 --> 00:39:37.640
You're about the only one
who can talk like that to a Blondie.

00:39:40.350 --> 00:39:41.350
Well?

00:39:44.520 --> 00:39:45.770
Say it.

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:49.240
Do it to me.

00:39:51.280 --> 00:39:53.120
Yes, that's better.

00:40:13.680 --> 00:40:14.720
Riki.

00:40:15.800 --> 00:40:18.020
Do you know what a wedge is?

00:40:19.850 --> 00:40:26.650
It's something that links two opposites together strongly, like you and Iason.

00:40:28.820 --> 00:40:31.650
I suppose people could call it love.

00:40:33.360 --> 00:40:34.530
But Riki,

00:40:35.700 --> 00:40:41.040
it's too late if you only realize it after you're wearing a Pet ring

00:40:41.040 --> 00:40:42.670
and can't do anything about it.

00:41:04.440 --> 00:41:08.070
Oh! Don't scare me like that, please.

00:41:08.070 --> 00:41:11.360
Actually, I've come for the rest of the money.

00:41:12.150 --> 00:41:14.360
Open that box over there.

00:41:26.750 --> 00:41:28.790
I hope it pleases you.

00:41:31.590 --> 00:41:33.550
I will also give you this.

00:41:35.550 --> 00:41:40.100
Killie, you must learn
the ways of Tanagura first.

00:41:40.100 --> 00:41:41.720
N-No way.

00:42:19.890 --> 00:42:20.600
Guy.

00:42:24.730 --> 00:42:26.730
You waited for me.

00:42:26.730 --> 00:42:28.690
It's my fault.

00:42:30.690 --> 00:42:33.730
Don't say that.
It's not like you.

00:42:34.190 --> 00:42:36.700
Can I go to your place?

00:42:36.700 --> 00:42:37.450
Yeah.

00:42:55.420 --> 00:42:56.380
Riki.

00:42:58.760 --> 00:43:02.470
Why don't we become
pairing partners again?

00:43:03.720 --> 00:43:07.560
I know something's happened to you in the last three years. But...

00:43:08.640 --> 00:43:12.980
That night you tried
to jump off to help us,

00:43:12.980 --> 00:43:16.530
even though you could
have died from it.

00:43:16.900 --> 00:43:20.490
Back then, you looked
just like the old Riki.

00:43:21.200 --> 00:43:22.910
The one I loved.

00:43:24.790 --> 00:43:27.450
The dazzlingly passionate Riki.

00:43:28.250 --> 00:43:29.410
Guy...

00:43:29.410 --> 00:43:32.710
That moment I thought,

00:43:32.710 --> 00:43:37.420
"It's fine the way it is.
He hasn't changed."

00:43:38.260 --> 00:43:40.930
Isn't that enough?

00:43:43.010 --> 00:43:46.850
I won't be selfish and say, "Forget everything,"

00:43:46.850 --> 00:43:50.350
but... can't we try again?

00:43:50.940 --> 00:43:52.900
Like when we first met.

00:43:52.900 --> 00:43:55.940
Let's try again. You and me.

00:43:59.950 --> 00:44:01.610
Guy, things are different.

00:44:02.160 --> 00:44:03.120
What's changed?

00:44:03.120 --> 00:44:04.910
Things are different!
Listen to me!

00:44:06.700 --> 00:44:11.160
Guy, it wasn't the police
who released you.

00:44:11.160 --> 00:44:16.250
Iason, that Blondie we saw at the auction,
pulled some strings with the police.

00:44:16.250 --> 00:44:17.130
You get it?

00:44:17.130 --> 00:44:21.680
What do you mean? Are you under some obligation to that Blondie?

00:44:22.550 --> 00:44:25.850
Well? C'mon, spit it out!

00:44:26.260 --> 00:44:27.680
I'm...

00:44:29.640 --> 00:44:32.900
I'm Iason's Pet.

00:44:35.860 --> 00:44:38.150
You? A Pet?!

00:44:38.690 --> 00:44:40.860
He put a Pet ring on me
down there.

00:44:40.860 --> 00:44:43.570
I've been licking his boots
for three years.

00:44:43.570 --> 00:44:46.410
And Guy, I am still, even now...

00:44:46.410 --> 00:44:51.200
You were released
because he... his hands...

00:44:51.200 --> 00:44:53.830
Iason caressed my whole body and...

00:44:58.670 --> 00:45:00.170
You idiot!

00:45:02.590 --> 00:45:07.600
You used to say you'd rather die
than suck up to anyone.

00:45:08.810 --> 00:45:11.020
A Blondie's Pet?

00:45:11.020 --> 00:45:15.190
Is... Is that your answer?

00:45:17.480 --> 00:45:18.730
I'm sorry.

00:45:19.980 --> 00:45:23.780
How could you let a guy
like that touch you?

00:45:23.780 --> 00:45:27.570
You used to have more pride
than anyone else.

00:45:34.620 --> 00:45:36.080
Get out!

00:45:37.250 --> 00:45:40.300
Don't ever come back here again.

00:46:11.580 --> 00:46:15.960
I'm so stupid. I knew
it would turn out like this.

00:46:46.490 --> 00:46:47.490
Riki...

00:47:24.980 --> 00:47:28.610
It was all just a dream.

00:47:36.580 --> 00:47:38.870
If you really want to be free,

00:47:39.290 --> 00:47:41.580
leave Tanagura.

00:48:00.230 --> 00:48:04.940
Orphan and M74 present
